# Vercel deployment ignore file.
#
# These directories contain large, S3-backed binary assets that are only used
# by local CLI tooling (the `minty` commands for generating item/comic/degen
# metadata and images). They are NOT used by any Express API route served in
# production, and the degen images are git-ignored. Excluding them keeps the
# serverless function bundle small and the upload fast.
assets/images/degens
assets/images/comics
assets/images/comics-disabled
assets/images/items
assets/images/hydra

# Never deploy local/test artifacts
coverage
*.log
